<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>A Morning at the Coffee Shop</title>

  <style>
    body {
      font-family: Georgia, serif;
      background: #ead5bd;
      color: #432c20;
      padding: 30px 15px;
      line-height: 1.9;
    }

    .story {
      background: #fffaf3;
      max-width: 700px;
      margin: auto;
      padding: 35px;
      border-radius: 18px;
      box-shadow: 0 5px 15px #68452b30;
    }

    h1, h2 {
      text-align: center;
    }

    h1 {
      font-size: 34px;
    }

    .coffee {
      text-align: center;
      font-size: 45px;
    }

    button {
      display: block;
      margin: 25px auto 0;
      padding: 12px 22px;
      background: #754c34;
      color: white;
      border: none;
      border-radius: 9px;
      cursor: pointer;
      font-size: 16px;
    }

    button:hover {
      background: #4b3025;
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>
  <div class="story">
    <div class="coffee">☕ 🥐</div>

    <h1>A Morning at the Coffee Shop</h1>

    <p>
      The little bell above the café door rings as you step
      inside. The smell of freshly ground coffee fills the air,
      mixing with the sweet scent of cinnamon pastries.
    </p>

    <p>
      Outside, rain taps gently against the windows. Inside,
      warm golden lights glow above wooden tables, and a soft
      song plays in the background. For a moment, the busy
      world outside seems very far away.
    </p>

    <p>
      You walk up to the counter, where a friendly barista
      smiles and asks, "What can I get started for you today?"
    </p>

    <p>
      You order your favorite drink and find a small table
      beside the window. As you take your first sip, you notice
      a little handwritten note tucked beneath the sugar jar.
    </p>

    <p>
      It reads: "Sometimes, the best stories begin in the most
      unexpected places."
    </p>

    <p>
      You look around the café. A student is writing in a
      notebook, an older couple is sharing a pastry, and
      someone near the fireplace is reading a worn-out book.
      Everyone seems to have a story of their own.
    </p>

    <p>
      You smile, settle into your chair, and open your own
      notebook. Maybe today will be the beginning of something
      wonderful.
    </p>

    <h2>The End... or Just the Beginning? ✨</h2>

    <button onclick="window.location.href='index.html'">
      ← Back to Home
    </button>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
